entry links back to the page it was distilled from.

This project reproduces no source prose verbatim and mirrors no images from
sources whose material is all-rights-reserved. Where a source's own terms are
more restrictive than CC BY 4.0, those terms govern that material, not this
license. Sources whose published research is the product they sell are excluded
from the corpus entirely; see the roadmap in README.md.

If you are the author of a source indexed here and want an entry changed or
removed, open an issue and it will be removed.
